# Keep the build context to the code. data/ holds the database, Garmin
# and Calendar tokens, the encrypted body photos and their key: none of
# it belongs in an image, and the photo folders are owner-only (0700),
# so a context that includes them makes `docker compose build` fail with
# "permission denied" as soon as the first photo is stored.
data/
.env
.git/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
